original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-66328","translationId":"2835","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1478227/824d166b4082b4ee83d5f599e5a5e5e6/720p","season":1,"ordinal":12}},{"id":"kodik-1978","dubId":"1978","label":"Dream Cast","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-66054","translationId":"1978","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1472942/38141b6023cdf762ab97ee7d12631532/720p","season":1,"ordinal":12}}],"season":1,"ordinal":12}],"translations":{"en":["The Too-Perfect Saint: Tossed Aside by My Fiancé and Sold to Another Kingdom","Philia’s family has produced saints for generations. It’s no surprise that she’s known as the greatest saint of all time—and set to marry the second prince, Julius. What no one expects is for Julius to call off the engagement, claiming that Philia’s perfection makes her charmless and unlikable. To add insult to injury, Philia is packed off to a neighboring country in exchange for gold and resources, forcing her to leave her homeland! Despite bracing herself for mistreatment, Philia finds a warm welcome in her new town, where she puts her saintly abilities to good use erecting barriers against monsters and curing epidemics. But even as she flourishes in her new life, her homeland is under threat of destruction!\n\n\n\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)\n\n\n\nNote: Each episode streamed 1 week early on ABEMA. The original TV broadcast started on April 3rd 2025."],"ja":["完璧すぎて可愛げがないと婚約破棄された聖女は隣国に売られる",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-66229":"2025-08-28T09:53:11Z","serial-66328":"2025-07-05T19:48:28Z","serial-66054":"2025-06-20T18:53:15Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-66229","serial-66328","serial-66054"],"relatedMalIds":[],"rating":7.24,"availableEpisodeCount":12}]}